WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.096 --> 00:00:01.480
Oh no!

2
00:00:01.432 --> 00:00:03.921
Cloud Town is growing too fast!

3
00:00:03.921 --> 00:00:07.149
Stands everywhere, and every one is different!

4
00:00:07.149 --> 00:00:10.297
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

5
00:00:10.297 --> 00:00:12.706
This is Episode 63.

6
00:00:12.706 --> 00:00:14.706
Meet the town hall crew.

7
00:00:14.706 --> 00:00:16.888
First, the town stamp.

8
00:00:16.888 --> 00:00:18.173
Stamp!

9
00:00:18.173 --> 00:00:21.139
A whole street pops up, exactly right.

10
00:00:21.139 --> 00:00:22.423
Stamp!

11
00:00:22.423 --> 00:00:24.787
Another one, just the same.

12
00:00:24.787 --> 00:00:26.821
That is CloudFormation.

13
00:00:26.821 --> 00:00:29.060
Next, the family rope.

14
00:00:29.060 --> 00:00:31.595
It loops the houses into neighborhoods.

15
00:00:31.595 --> 00:00:33.913
One town, all together.

16
00:00:33.913 --> 00:00:36.016
That is Organizations.

17
00:00:36.016 --> 00:00:39.721
The lighthouse sets up each new neighborhood, safe from day one.

18
00:00:39.721 --> 00:00:41.732
That is Control Tower.

19
00:00:41.732 --> 00:00:45.187
And the magic toolbox fixes every stand at once.

20
00:00:45.187 --> 00:00:47.312
Tap, tap, done!

21
00:00:47.312 --> 00:00:49.404
That is Systems Manager.

22
00:00:49.404 --> 00:00:52.018
Four helpers, one tidy town.

23
00:00:52.018 --> 00:00:54.245
Now you know the town hall crew!

24
00:00:54.245 --> 00:00:57.700
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

